            { "text": "Microsoft Entra 専用認証の組み込みポリシー適用中は復元不可。CMK 暗号化は再構成が必要", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/azure-sql/database/deleted-logical-server-restore", "locator": "制限事項", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-18T20:18:00Z" }] },
